{
  "dom_id": "step-e832",
  "name": "Example: Identifying Equivalent Expressions with Negative Terms",
  "problem": "Find an  expression  equivalent to $-\\dfrac{2}9 (-z).$",
  "worked_solution": "First, remember that the product of two negative numbers is a positive number. Thus, \n\n$$\n-\\dfrac{2}9 (-z) = \\dfrac{2}{9} z.\n$$\n\nNow, writing $z$ as $\\dfrac{z}{1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{9}z & =\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot z \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{z}{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot z}{9\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2z}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the expressions $-\\dfrac{2}9 (-z)$ and $\\dfrac{2z}{9}$ are equivalent.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e832\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying Equivalent Expressions with Negative Terms</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e832\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n            